00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:48.160
Basic posture consists of lying face-up
with your hands folded behind your head.

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:52.370
Lift up your head while also
clenching your stomach.

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:57.870
Then bend one knee and
touch it to the opposite elbow.

00:10:57.870 --> 00:11:01.330
Right leg to left elbow, and vice versa.

00:11:01.330 --> 00:11:03.450
You just need to alternate between them!

00:11:03.450 --> 00:11:06.580
It's simple to do this at home!

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:08.540
Bicycle crunches can work out your
rectus abdominis, oblique abdominals,

