00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:05.040
So, what're the benefits of using a sauna?

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:05.830
Well, it improves blood circulation!

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:07.910
"Improved Blood Circulation"
Well, it improves blood circulation!

00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:14.040
